  m_text: "Wait briefly while artworks load. Walk around your virtual gallery physically,
    or use pinch gestures (zoom-in/out) to navigate easily even in limited spaces.
    Tap individual artworks to see detailed information like title, artist, and creation
    date.\n\nEnhanced Weather Effects: In the Weather Gallery, enjoy immersive visual
    effects matching your local weather conditions\u2014experience gentle rain, drifting
    snow, sunlight, or clouds that enhance your exploration."
